      "writtenOn": "2020-10-22T19:55:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you know how the fuzzer runs? Does it run as root or an unprivileged user?\n\nselinux_android_setcontext(), if successful, has side effects such as changing the SELinux context (and others???). It seems like we need to fix the fuzzer to undo any successful context change, no?",
      "revId": "4e3527ec78ed5edc702291ca4d3038e94de5b04e",
